.git
.gitignore
.github
.vscode
.devcontainer

# Build artifacts and IDE caches
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/bin
!bin/
**/obj
**/coverage
.gocache
.projindex
.seek
build

# Unused portals and platform-specific
Android
iOS
customer_portal
partner_portal
system_portal
backups

# Docs and specs (not needed for builds)
logs
docs
documentation
api/docs
api/templates
api/postman
api/generator/__pycache__
proto
rules
specs

# Temp and junk files
**/*.log
**/*.tmp
**/.DS_Store

# Large binary/archive files
*.tar
*.tar.gz
*.zip
*.tgz
acli.exe
check_ssl.go

# Exclude sdks directory EXCEPT the specific SDK tgz needed by b2b_portal Dockerfile
# NOTE: the !exception MUST come AFTER the *.tgz rule — last matching rule wins in Docker
sdks
!sdks/insuretech-typescript-sdk/lifeplus-insuretech-sdk-0.1.0.tgz

# NOTE: b2b_portal is NOT excluded — the b2b_portal Dockerfile needs it.
# **/node_modules and **/.next above already exclude the large subdirs inside it.
